gts6l mainline Linux, licensing
===============================

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

The kernel and driver code in this repository (everything under kernel/, the
brcmfmac and PCIe and ACPM sources, the device tree, and the kernel patches) is
derived from the Linux kernel and is therefore licensed under the GNU General
Public License version 2 (GPL-2.0-only), the same terms as the Linux kernel it
derives from. The build and flash tooling and the documentation are provided
under the same terms for simplicity.

The Project Aloha UEFI firmware and DualBootKernelPatcher referenced by the boot
method are upstream projects under their own licenses; this repository documents
their use but does not vendor them.

The full text of the GNU General Public License version 2 is the canonical
document at https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.txt and is the
identical text shipped as COPYING in the Linux kernel source tree. If you
redistribute this repository, include that full license text as this LICENSE
file (drop in the kernel COPYING verbatim).

NOT covered by this license
---------------------------

No proprietary firmware is included in this repository. Broadcom and Samsung
firmware, NVRAM, calibration data, partition dumps, IMEI or EFS data, and
Samsung stock images are deliberately excluded. Those files remain the property
of their respective owners, are not licensed here, and must be extracted from
your own device (see firmware/README.md). Do not add them to a public fork.
